Track 1: Chrysalis Waking In Silt
- Story & Context: Old Ma-Lay finds a discarded digital watch in the riverbed at dawn, its alarm ticking like a cicada against the silence of the market. She realizes the rhythm perfectly matches the vibration of the glass gongs she is polishing for the morning trade. The conflict arises when the watch begins to speed up, forcing the market to open an hour too early for the sleepy ghosts. "Tick-hiss, the clockwork skin begins to shed."
